  by: agent  # a370
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a370
  clock: 2  # a370
  nonce: a370  # a370
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: the item's DONE-WHEN fixture reads inconclusive on host_secret->logging and ->host_fs ('variadic_call at main.c:13'); main->log_print carries unfollowed_construct=variadic_call and vfprintf is an unclassified external (no c.yaml row). Premise correction: fprintf is rowed fs_write (zone host_fs) and stderr is only a logging attribute, so a direct fprintf(stderr,..) control reads host_fs violated but logging confirmed; the DONE-WHEN claim must be host_secret->host_fs (or the stderr->logging split decided first). MECHANISM: c_def_use has no pseudo-parameter for ..., so va_start/va_list carry nothing; v*printf family uncatalogued. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-ropab."  # a370
